@startuml activity_diagram
' DermaTrack — Core end-to-end workflow: scan -> severity -> (consent) -> review -> follow-up
title DermaTrack core workflow
|Patient|
start
:Sign in (role resolved);
:Capture scan (quick full-face\nor per-region session);
|System|
:Upload image to private Storage;
:analyze-scan: Roboflow detect + HF classify;
:Compute Cook grade -> Mild/Moderate/Severe;
:Save scan row; show result + guidance\n(+ non-diagnostic disclaimer);
|Patient|
if (Result Moderate/Severe?) then (yes)
  :Guidance nudges dermatologist review;
  if (Grant doctor consent?) then (yes)
    |Doctor|
    :Patient appears in consenting list;
    :Review scans, history, severity trend;
    :Write note / treatment plan / prescription;
    |System|
    :Surfaces in patient Notification Center;
  else (no)
    |Patient|
    :Continue self-monitoring;
  endif
else (no)
  |Patient|
  :Continue routine;
endif
|System|
:Schedule reminders (daily / 2-day / weekly);
:Severity-change & missed-scan alerts;
|Patient|
:Next scan (follow-up) -> trend updates;
stop
@enduml
